# TwothMatch Web Conventions

## Stack

Next.js App Router · TypeScript · Tailwind v4 + shadcn · Redux (auth) · React Hook Form + Zod · external JWT API

## Project layout

```
src/
  app/                    # routes & layouts (App Router)
    (main)/               # authenticated app — includes AppHeader
    auth/                 # login, register, verify-email
  components/
    ui/                   # shadcn primitives
    layout/               # header, providers shell, placeholders
  features/<domain>/      # domain UI, forms, services, hooks
  lib/                    # routes, store, theme, shared utils, API
```

Feature modules: `components/`, `form/` (Zod), `services/`, `hooks/`, `utils/` as needed.

## Routing

- All paths from `@/lib/routes` — never hardcode strings
- `appRoutes.home` → `/` (feed; no separate marketing landing)
- `appRoutes.nav.*` → header tabs: `/`, `/matches`, `/my-jobs`, `/invites`, `/events`
- `appRoutes.auth.*`, `appRoutes.profile`, `externalApiRoutes` + `apiPath()` for API
- New app pages go under `src/app/(main)/` so they inherit the authenticated header layout
- Placeholder pages: use `PlaceholderPage` from `@/components/layout/placeholder-page`

## Auth

- Session in Redux + `token-storage`; hydrate via `StoreProvider`
- Post-login redirect: `appRoutes.home._self.path`
- Auth pages wrap with `RedirectIfAuthenticated`; protect client routes with `useRequireAuth` when needed
- `AppHeader` is for signed-in app chrome only — `(main)/layout.tsx`; do not add unauthenticated fallbacks there

## Theme

- **Single source of truth**: hex CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css`
- Do not add a TypeScript palette mirror unless JS-only consumers (charts) require it
- **Light mode only** for now: `isDarkModeEnabled = false` in `lib/theme/theme-config.ts`
- Provider: `AppThemeProvider` (`next-themes`, `forcedTheme="light"`)
- Brand tokens (edit in `:root` only):

| Token                | Hex       | Role              |
| -------------------- | --------- | ----------------- |
| `--background`       | `#f4f4f4` | Page canvas       |
| `--card`             | `#ffffff` | Elevated surfaces |
| `--primary`          | `#923CF6` | Brand purple      |
| `--muted`            | `#e0e0e0` | Subtle fills      |
| `--foreground`       | `#272643` | Headings          |
| `--muted-foreground` | `#6e6e88` | Secondary text    |
| `--border`           | `#e2e2e2` | Hairlines         |

## Forms & API

- Zod schemas in `features/<name>/form/`
- Client services return `AppResponseType<T>` from `@/lib/types/response`
- API paths via `externalApiRoutes` + `apiPath()`

## Design

- Match elevation: gray page + white cards/header — see `shadcn.mdc` for token usage in components

## Documentation

JSDoc on exported functions, types, and non-obvious variables. Keep diffs focused; don't refactor unrelated code.
